	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/vr_controls/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Aiming with the controller, your hands: with arms\nfrom the shoulders, floating, or the game's arms."/>
		<string text="What aims: the right controller, which holds the\nweapon, your head, or a gamepad's right stick."/>
		<string text="With a gamepad, the right stick turns and\npitches the view, only turns it, or in steps."/>
		<string text="The left grip holds a long gun by its foregrip:\nit aims along the line between your hands."/>
		<string text="Near an enemy your aim is slow to leave it, and\nzoomed, it is drawn gently toward it."/>
		<string text="A hard swing of the right controller melees, as\nB does; with its grip held, a softer one will do."/>
		<string text="Reach over your right shoulder for a long gun, or\nto your right hip for a pistol, and grip to draw it."/>
		<string text="Crouch in the room and you crouch in the game;\nstand up and you stand."/>
		<string text="Smart-link: the right stick's click zooms on your\nvisor. At the eye: raise the scope to your eye."/>
		<string text="Take a magazine from your left hip and push it\nin: loaded at once. X still reloads."/>
		<string text="How the right stick turns you: in steps, or\ncontinuously."/>
		<string text="How far each snap turn turns you."/>
		<string text="How fast smooth turning turns you, the stick\npushed all the way: degrees a second."/>
		<string text="In a vehicle's seat, the view from your head, or\nthe game's camera following the vehicle."/>
		<string text="As you die, the view stays where your head was\n(turned to your body in a blink), or the game's."/>
		<string text="The hand that holds the weapon, your height, the\nworld's scale, the HUD, the menus, the resolution."/>
	</strings>
